cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Couret-Unification: Finite Exact Spectral Core on (Z/30Z)× in Lean 4"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as follows."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Couret"
    given-names: "Alexandre"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Rasiguères, France"
abstract: >
  224 Lean 4 files, 0 sorry, 3510 jobs. Finite exact spectral core
  on (Z/30Z)× with 29 machine-certified results including Cayley
  spectrum, 63/255 classification, Parseval tower, coercive gap,
  and universal trace recurrence. No proof of RH is claimed.
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - number theory
  - finite spectral model
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - modular arithmetic
version: "32.20"
date-released: "2026-04-08"
